    "title": "Here’s When ‘Daredevil: Born Again’ Season 2 Is On The Docket This Spring",
    "text": "The esteemed Devil of Hell’s Kitchenis back, again. Cancel your Tuesday night plans, because it’s about to be watching Matt Murdock hours! Here’s everything you need to know to keep up with Daredevil: Born Again Season 2.It’s not enough for this show to resurrect Charlie Cox’s slutty blind Catholic lawyer by day and blind Catholic vigilante by night. It also has to basically bring back an entire series of Marvel comics adaptations that used to be very much doing their own thing on Netflix. The first season saw the MCU debut of Jon Bernthal as Frank Castle/The Punisher. The second season will give us back Krysten Ritter as the super-strong private detective a.k.a. Jessica Jones. You’re not going to want to miss that reunion, or anything else the new season has in store.When did Daredevil: Born Again season 2 premiere?According to IMDb and some other sources, the first two episodes of the new season will drop on Disney+ Tuesday, March 24, 2026. New episodes will appear on the platform at 9pm ET / 6pm PT.How many episodes are there in Daredevil: Born Again season 2?There are eight episodes coming to Disney+ this time around. For those keeping score, that’s one fewer than the previous season of Daredevil: Born Again.However, those who enjoy this particular corner of the MCU are not going to be starved for content in 2026. We’ve got Spider-Man: Brand New Day coming at the end of July, which will feature at least two characters who have appeared on Daredevil: Born Again if not more. There’s also going to be an untitled Punisher special episode that will presumably drop on Disney+ at some point between Born Again and Brand New Day. Marvel’s New York City is going to be going through it this year.Behold the Daredevil: Born Again season 2 full episode release schedule:Episode 1:\"The Northern Star\" — Airs March 24, 2026Episode 2: \"Shoot the Moon\" — Airs March 31, 2026Episode 3: \"The Scales and The Sword: — Airs March 31, 2026Episode 4: \"Gloves Off\" — Airs April 7, 2026Episode 5: \"The Grand Design\" — Airs April 14, 2026Episode 6: \"Requiem\" — Airs April 21, 2026Episode 7: \"The Hateful Darkness\" — Airs April 28, 2026Episode 8: \"The Southern Cross\" — Airs May 5, 2026",
